en|Filter housing union adapter|Push-fit reducing elbow|Inline pressure-reducing valve|Four-port valve|Leak shutoff device|Choosing connections and controls for water treatment|Ask for the male thread standard, the outside diameter of the PP-R pipe to be fusion joined, the housing model and the parts supplied.|The left elbow is marked 4分 and the right elbow 3分. Record the tube outside diameter and thread standard separately for each version.|Request the inlet and outlet sizes for each model, the permitted inlet pressure, the outlet setting and the flow direction.|Request the manufacturer's circuit drawing identifying every port, the tubing size and the condition that operates the valve.|Confirm the connection sizes, trigger and reset procedure, and the purpose and supplied quantity of the wrapped disc.|Enquiry checklist|Equipment model · close-up of each port · pipe marking or measured outside diameter · required function · quantity
